    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Independent creative advertising agency founded London 1996; one of the last large independents in the UK, resisting acquisition as of 2025. 250+ people in London; further offices in New York, Los Angeles, Shanghai, Berlin; sister agency The Secret Little Agency in Singapore. Client roster includes KFC, M&S, IKEA, Uber Eats, Anthropic, Samsung. Operates as a full-service creative company with subsidiary units covering design (Mother Design), media (Media by Mother), and ventures. Capabilities tag is currently Graphic design (clipper default); actual output spans campaign ideation, TV/film, brand strategy, copywriting, and creative direction. Proposal to expand Capabilities is in Open Questions.",
      "source_url": null,
      "verified_at": "2026-07-13T10:35:06",
