    },
    "Open Questions": {
      "value": "1. Capabilities: clipper set Graphic design only, but Mother is a full-service ad agency. Add Brand strategy, Copywriting, Creative direction, Film & video production? 2. Keep/use? Mother is a 250-person global agency (not a hands-on studio), so it sits differently from individual studios and designers in the DB. Confirm this entry is worth maintaining.",
